      "snippet": {
        "line": 1640,
        "text": "def PolynomialEdgeJets (W : Set Inner) (zeta delta : Inner → ℝ) (f : Inner → V) : Prop := ∀ m : ℕ, ∃ C : ℝ, 0 < C ∧ ∃ N : ℕ, ∀ w ∈ W, ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ m f w‖ ≤ C * zeta w * (delta w)⁻¹ ^ N"
